                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4174a9de-ecf8-3f5c-a69a-718edaba9f8b",
                        "entry_id": "6e8800db-b072-3f80-8a9f-ed1f03ea9158",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Angehöriger des Volkes Israel"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "im Alten Testament"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "dc771763-4caf-41b3-9064-978cb215f4d9",
                                "sense_id": "4174a9de-ecf8-3f5c-a69a-718edaba9f8b",
                                "text": "„Schon zweihundert Jahre vor Christi Geburt hatten andere Propheten verkündet, der versprochene Messias werde der Erlöser der ganzen Welt sein. Er werde nicht nur die Israeliten vom fremden Joch befreien, sondern alle Menschen von Sünde und Schuld erlösen — und nicht zuletzt vom Tod.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6bb1fc06-7375-3650-aafe-ae4adc7bcd5e",
                        "entry_id": "6e8800db-b072-3f80-8a9f-ed1f03ea9158",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Angehöriger der mosaischen Gemeinschaft, des jüdischen Glaubens"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "allgemeiner"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cb13d56e-f851-42fd-8a35-c65d4c39e618",
                                "sense_id": "6bb1fc06-7375-3650-aafe-ae4adc7bcd5e",
                                "text": "So antwortet denn, ihr vorerst — zu den andern reden wir nachher! — ihr, die ihr euch fromme Christen nennt und wahrhafte Israeliter, antwortet denn: Seid und tut und glaubt ihr wirklich wie Christus war und tat und glaubte und wie die Israeliter?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2bcdeb94-8ffe-4282-86f7-cec5f8045e86",
                                "sense_id": "6bb1fc06-7375-3650-aafe-ae4adc7bcd5e",
                                "text": "„In einem kleinen Winkel der Welt lebten Menschen, die sich selbst zunächst Hebräer, später nach ihrem Stammvater Israeliten oder Juden nannten und die sich zu einer neuartigen Schöpfungsgeschichte bekannten.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3cd1ca63-8a6f-42d3-8b9c-0fc01a9efd8c",
                        "source_entry_id": "6e8800db-b072-3f80-8a9f-ed1f03ea9158",
                        "source_sense_id": "4174a9de-ecf8-3f5c-a69a-718edaba9f8b",
                        "source_sense_description": "im Alten Testament: Angehöriger des Volkes Israel",
                        "target_lang_word": "Israelite",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Israelite",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cbe93c11-5abf-3662-96c7-ef6d04d524cc",
                                        "entry_id": "965bac67-f114-385f-8779-0969850c9aac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A native or inhabitant of"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1cd53a7e-d23f-4b05-b7c8-4242b0a695c1",
                                                "sense_id": "cbe93c11-5abf-3662-96c7-ef6d04d524cc",
                                                "text": "Celesliall brightnesse ceazed on his face,\nThat did the wondring Israelites amaze,\nWhen he returned from that souereigne place,\nHis browes encireled with splendidious rayes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "075d2fb5-e39e-46cf-b348-ba524cd847fa",
                                                "sense_id": "cbe93c11-5abf-3662-96c7-ef6d04d524cc",
                                                "text": "The token of God is upon him, let him now, by his own profession of faith, acknowledge it, as God's token, bringing him under the responsibilities and blessings of the covenant, and he will be received, unquestionably, as \"an Israelite indeed.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27248e4c-b9f4-49d6-b360-71e27a35999f",
                                                "sense_id": "cbe93c11-5abf-3662-96c7-ef6d04d524cc",
                                                "text": "Papponymy is not documented among Israelites. The only exception, Tahat son of 'Elyada' son of Tahat is doubtful and is not a papponymy sensu stricto."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a81b5c2e-2afe-3b95-9002-8f4dfd8753f0",
                                        "entry_id": "965bac67-f114-385f-8779-0969850c9aac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A native or inhabitant of\\n (i) the united nation of ancient Israel (under the Judges, and then kings Saul, David and Solomon), or\\n (ii) the later ancient northern kingdom centered in Samaria, distinct from the kingdom of Judah centered in Jerusalem.",
                                            "the united nation of ancient Israel (under the Judges, and then kings Saul, David and Solomon), or"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0a3a844f-5bc1-3aa2-94ca-633cfa9970e2",
                                        "entry_id": "965bac67-f114-385f-8779-0969850c9aac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A native or inhabitant of\\n (i) the united nation of ancient Israel (under the Judges, and then kings Saul, David and Solomon), or\\n (ii) the later ancient northern kingdom centered in Samaria, distinct from the kingdom of Judah centered in Jerusalem.",
                                            "the later ancient northern kingdom centered in Samaria, distinct from the kingdom of Judah centered in Jerusalem."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b4ec8368-2f23-3ded-929b-20130c6bda31",
                                        "entry_id": "965bac67-f114-385f-8779-0969850c9aac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A member of the Twelve Tribes of Israel and a descendant of Jacob."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8f9f0aaa-294f-330b-b6df-43b53ea2474e",
                                        "entry_id": "965bac67-f114-385f-8779-0969850c9aac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A member of the Jewish people who is neither a cohen nor a Levite."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9947c61b-1a97-37a3-b41a-533a5839e6c5",
